    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3fc1539d2f5743683ebb17</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 06:47:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔一个月，荤仔终于复盘了自己5月底的生日之旅，8年后再到菲律宾，还是喜欢海岛快乐老家啊（不过下次能不能去个发达国家玩儿？由于本人过于兴奋，所以说话语速过快，下期会调整，斯密马赛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">00:01:54</a> 菲律宾彩虹团，姐妹们的出片任务真的很重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">00:03:35</a> Day 1 宿务浮潜看沙丁鱼风暴大满足，错过鲸鲨小可惜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">00:09:19</a> Day 2 超原始版溯溪跳岛，全员变悬崖上的猴、跳诛仙台的素素</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">00:17:56</a> Day 3&amp; Day 4 薄荷岛酒店躺平，在海边的巧克力马杀鸡想再做一百遍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">00:20:36</a> Day 5&amp;Day 6阿罗纳海滩上的小女孩声音超纯净，超感动😭，射击初体验，荤仔收获致命女人的称号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">00:36:27</a> 据说有治愈力的水都是咸的，比如泪水、汗水和海水，这辈子可能也没法儿对海水戒断了，那就尽量多送自己几次夏日海岛之旅吧</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FleALAzdBqalHTxAhpaTbEo1ypGX.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flu5AAy4OAEr-dX-2LGDi_uTUaCr.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpA8yTnHrYOWkU3dT6Wb1jXU9C3d.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6V7ov2pMxmp3hLs5CJK8DgYKQi.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxmuslWIzSNr3ygmua--OM_7nkQ.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdtgjLFYM9-31vX7H-5_5GyVTkz.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQWPkZtuKgBiuJiB8jjFhImzXfq.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZDF5A5RCXCbgASEMyGEKcunWR8.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniwDnoZ2OKXXZIR_jK54Np3hmvO.png"><p></p>]]></description>
